  "text": "NICE Guideline CG150: Headaches in Over 12s Diagnosis and Management | Publisher: National\nMigraine Self-Care & Environmental Comfort\nMigraine presents as episodic throbbing headache often accompanied by\nnausea or sensitivity to light and sound. Comfort Measures: - Rest in a\nquiet, dark room during acute attacks. - Apply a cool cloth or ice pack\nwrapped in a towel to the forehead or temples. - Maintain regular sleep,\nmeal, and exercise schedules to reduce migraine frequency.\nPage 3 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
